How much is that?

564
00:18:56,050 --> 00:18:59,450
About $1,700 for every person in America.

565
00:18:59,670 --> 00:19:01,910
It was the biggest one-day loss in

566
00:19:01,910 --> 00:19:02,910
market history.

567
00:19:03,250 --> 00:19:05,870
NVIDIA reports its earnings on the 17th of

568
00:19:05,870 --> 00:19:06,250
November.

569
00:19:06,530 --> 00:19:08,770
The congressmen get their briefing the next day.

570
00:19:08,950 --> 00:19:11,350
And two weeks later, Jensen walks onto a

571
00:19:11,350 --> 00:19:13,790
stage in Washington, the same city as the

572
00:19:13,790 --> 00:19:15,250
people who never told him.

573
00:19:15,410 --> 00:19:16,270
And Alice Huang?

574
00:19:16,490 --> 00:19:17,870
She's gone from MegaSpeed.

575
00:19:17,870 --> 00:19:19,930
Her name has been taken off its company

576
00:19:19,930 --> 00:19:20,430
