577
00:19:20,770 --> 00:19:22,370
Nobody has said where she is.

578
00:19:22,650 --> 00:19:24,230
Go back to that dinner in Singapore.

579
00:19:24,550 --> 00:19:26,490
The candles, the toast to friends.

580
00:19:26,850 --> 00:19:29,070
The chair next to Jensen is empty now.

581
00:19:29,250 --> 00:19:29,970
We make friends.

582
00:19:30,350 --> 00:19:32,750
America watched her at his table for almost

583
00:19:32,750 --> 00:19:35,110
two years and never told him.

584
00:19:35,270 --> 00:19:37,290
So who's pulling up a chair next to

585
00:19:37,290 --> 00:19:39,650
the people who build America's AI tonight?

586
00:19:39,990 --> 00:19:41,910
Jensen ended his letter like this.

587
00:19:42,030 --> 00:19:44,130
I love our country and our company.

588
00:19:44,330 --> 00:19:46,330
I am proud and grateful to be an

589
00:19:46,330 --> 00:19:46,670
American.
